"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"},{"label":"Took on a material obligation","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000198251825000026/0001982518-25-000026-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-05-14","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000198251825000016/0001982518-25-000016-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-03-12","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000198251825000004/0001982518-25-000004-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-11-12","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000198251824000003/0001982518-24-000003-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-08-14","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000114036124037175/0001140361-24-037175-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[],"summary":{"sentences":["Smith Douglas Homes Corp. files with the SEC under \"Operative Builders\", based in GA, and has been publicly reporting for 2 years.","It reported $917.1m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 8.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 19.6%.","Listed on NYSE, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 19 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Net cash of $28.0m against total assets of $600.2m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.9% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 8.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 23.8% to 19.6% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"},{"text":"Gross margin is only 19.6%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"},{"text":"About 19 months of cash at the current burn ($28.0m against $17.3m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1982518/000162828026028919/0001628280-26-028919-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028919"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 12.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","thr